### Catalog Service REST API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8082
### Gateway URL: http://localhost:8080

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082/api/v1/catalog
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/catalog
@restaurantId = RESTAURANT-001

###############################################
# Health Check
###############################################

### Health Check - Direct
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

### Health Check - Via Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

###############################################
# Menu Endpoints
###############################################

### 1. Get Full Menu (All Available Items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Full Menu - Via Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Menu by Category - Pizzas
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}/category/PIZZA
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Menu by Category - Drinks
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}/category/DRINK
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Menu by Category - Sides
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}/category/SIDE
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Menu by Category - Desserts
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}/category/DESSERT
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Featured Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}/featured
Accept: application/json

### 8. Search Menu Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}/search?query=margherita
Accept: application/json

### 9. Search Menu Items - Pizza
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/{{restaurantId}}/search?query=pizza
Accept: application/json

