###############################################
# Notes
###############################################

# How to use:
# 1. Install REST Client extension in VS Code
# 2. Click "Send Request" above each request
# 3. View response in split pane
# 4. Replace placeholder IDs with actual values from responses

# First time setup:
# 1. Start infrastructure: docker-compose up -d
# 2. Start discovery-service: cd services/discovery-service && mvn spring-boot:run
# 3. Start catalog-service: cd services/catalog-service && mvn spring-boot:run
# 4. Wait ~30 seconds for registration
# 5. Run GET menu request to see auto-initialized data
